🛡️ Best Practices
State Isolation: Each agent should only modify its own section in agent_data

Default Values: Initialize all expected keys in agent_data

Immutable Updates: Always create new state objects instead of modifying existing ones

Type Safety: Use type hints for complex state structures

Namespace: Prefix agent-specific keys with agent names to prevent collisions

